    "text": "Company Close Updates\nOracle Corp. stock outperforms competitors on strong trading day\nShares of Oracle Corp. ORCL rallied 6.67% to $203.70 Thursday, on what proved to be an all-around favorable trading session for the stock market, with the S&P 500 Index SPX rising 0.58% to 7,563.63 and the Dow Jones Industrial Average DJIA rising 0.05% to 50,668.97.\nOracle Corp. closed 41.08% below its 52-week high of $345.72, which the company reached on September 10th.\nAbout the Author",
